# ===========================================================================
# Claude Code skills (third-party, not this repo's own .claude/*.md)
# ===========================================================================
# .claude/skills/ holds skills installed from external marketplaces (e.g.
# supabase/agent-skills) via the skills CLI/manager -- Supabase maintains
# that one, not us. skills-lock.json tracks installed versions. Neither
# belongs in this repo; re-install locally instead of committing them.
.claude/skills/
skills-lock.json

# ===========================================================================
# Intentionally committed — do NOT add to .gitignore
# ===========================================================================
# As a reminder to future-you: these are committed on purpose.
#
#   CLAUDE.md, SPEC.md, EXPERIMENTS.md, README.md  ← the harness
#   .claude/*.md                                    ← skill files
#   backend/alembic/versions/*.py                   ← migration history
#   backend/evals/fixtures/*                        ← real eval images + JSON
#   backend/evals/reports/*.md                      ← committed eval reports
#   backend/tests/fixtures/*                        ← small synthetic fixtures
#   .github/workflows/*.yml                         ← CI config
#   .env.example                                    ← env var template
#
# If any of these accidentally get ignored, the harness breaks.
